%% The MCP server (17.1): any MCP client gets Yaan's read-only tools, plus ask, over stdio or HTTP.
flowchart LR
  CL["MCP client<br/>Claude Code, Claude Desktop,<br/>Cursor, another agent"]:::ext --> T{"Transport<br/>stdio: yaan mcp<br/>HTTP: /mcp on the API<br/>(localhost host guard)"}:::guard
